Table full name: TCGA.TCGA_VERSIONED.CLINICAL_DIAGNOSES_TREATMENTS_GDC_R29
Column name: diag__treat__treatment_type Type: TEXT Description: Text term that describes the kind of treatment administered.
Column name: diag__treat__treatment_or_therapy Type: TEXT Description: A yes/no/unknown/not applicable indicator related to the administration of therapeutic agents received.
Column name: case_id Type: TEXT Description: GDC unique identifier for this case (corresponds to the case_barcode) -- this can be used to access more information from the GDC data portal in the following way: https://portal.gdc.cancer.gov/files/c21b332c-06c6-4403-9032-f91c8f407ba9.
Column name: diag__diagnosis_id Type: TEXT Description: GDC-assigned identifier for a case's diagnosis.
