Column name: file_gdc_id Type: TEXT Description: Unique GDC identifier for this file (corresponds to the file_barcode)--this can be used to access more information from the GDC data portal like this: https://portal.gdc.cancer.gov/files/c21b332c-06c6-4403-9032-f91c8f407ba4
